WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.350
What’s the greatest desire of SCP-573, the
Pied Pipe, the sinister, child-controlling

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:08.300
fruit made of human bones?

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.180
A photo was taken of it laying in its container,
and the result was…

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.180
Well…

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.020
The results are technically redacted due to
being extremely disturbing.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:22.970
But Dr. Bright did leave a comment saying,
“It appears as if 573 is indeed sentient,

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:24.079
in any case.”

